WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.244
A skip-counting pattern adds or subtracts the same step at every landing. Check both

00:00:05.244 --> 00:00:06.685
forward and backward travel.

00:00:07.533 --> 00:00:19.732
Count 5 jumps back in 2,000s from 50,000. The answer is 40,000. 50,000 minus 5 times

00:00:19.732 --> 00:00:22.019
2,000 equals 40,000.

00:00:22.867 --> 00:00:29.126
A route during a reading competition moves 4 jumps of 1,000 backward from 19,000.

00:00:29.126 --> 00:00:33.149
Where does it finish? Pause to choose and explain.

00:00:33.950 --> 00:00:42.529
A route during a reading competition moves 4 jumps of 1,000 backward from 19,000.

00:00:42.529 --> 00:00:51.721
Where does it finish? The answer is 15,000. 19,000 minus 4 times 1,000 equals 15,000.
